🟡 **SUGGESTION: duplicated model-pick block across two test files**

This 10-line "tap model row → expect `MediaSlotModelPage` → free-text entry →
Save" sequence is now copy-pasted verbatim in
`flutter_app/test/onboarding_screen_test.dart:252` and here. If the selector's
save button stops being a `FilledButton` or the row label changes, two files
break in lockstep.

Consider extracting a shared helper, e.g. a `WidgetTester` extension in a test
utility file:

```dart
extension ModelPicking on WidgetTester {
  Future<void> pickModel(String modelId) async {
    await tap(find.text('Model id'));
    await pumpAndSettle();
    expect(find.byType(MediaSlotModelPage), findsOneWidget);
    await enterText(find.widgetWithText(TextField, 'Model id'), modelId);
    await tap(find.widgetWithText(FilledButton, 'Save'));
    await pumpAndSettle();
  }
}
```

Acceptable to keep as-is for a 2-site copy, but it will grow with the next e2e
that configures a provider.

